Sītā falls senseless hearing dreadful word --- Sītā laments pure wife abandoned to sorrow --- Sītā refuses suicide sparing husband lineage --- Sītā sends welfare to mothers and king --- Sītā bids Rāma win citizens by righteousness --- Lakṣmaṇa circumambulates weeping and recrosses --- Lakṣmaṇa mounts chariot glancing back repeatedly --- Lone Sītā wails in peacock-resounding forest